<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4198" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλῐθος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without stones, not
			stony</i>, of lands, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				6.4.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>without a stone</i> set in it, of a ring, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.179
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>free from the stone</i>, as disease, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CD</u>
				2.3
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
